  "summary": "My name is Colin D. Smith and I am currently enrolled at The Art Institute of Houston (about to graduate) majoring in Web Design and Interactive Media. Before coming to AIH, I graduated from high school where I helped run the website with a team of four others for two years. After graduating I had three weeks of summer break before starting class in July. I am also an Eagle Scout from the Boy Scouts of America. I achieved this rank on January 31, 2012 and had my ceremony later in February. I have experience with HTML and CSS coding, and am currently learning jQuery. I have used many Adobe programs such as Dreamweaver, Illustrator, Muse, Photoshop, After Effects, Premiere and Flash. I have enjoyed my time in school, but I am currently looking for a place to gain work experience and continue to grow my knowledge of web design and coding.",
